    "new_consumers": ["run_control_preparation_oracle.py", "run_material_control_preparation.py"],
    "generic_physical_entrypoints": "MaterialControlInputs.load_material_inputs returns original generic MaterialInputs for reconstruct_reference/H0/K. build_real_pw_factors explicitly validates RealBlochBasis and calls the existing shared physical k+G algebra with new honest provenance. No existing unitary/loaded production wrapper is relabelled.",
    "memory_execution": "One original source plus one inherited-order target basis during complete source admission; only selected source/target full raw frames and band-square Gram/D. No PW-square density or Hamiltonian, full trajectory, or all-grid frame cache.",
    "primary_geometry": "Both the accepted case final.extxyz and selected attempt final.extxyz are bound and preserved separately; original selected XML positions/cell/order define physical APIs. Registered initial seeds never replace final geometry.",
    "output_ledger": "mesh-source-admission.json records every original spin/source header/cutoff and every full-grid basis, row digest, source coefficient digest, symmetry/conjugation/fold and original XML weight. population-ledger.npz uses explicit per-slot band_slices (not loaded-only hardcoded346). selected-real-frame-state.npz retains all raw rows/columns, source and target Gram/D, density eigenvalues, raw MV metadata and independent direct-target comparison."
