  "scope": "Saved-primary matched input intake and explicit within-spin orbital conjugation canonical extension. Not physical spin-flipping time reversal, trajectory, equilibrium, numerical convergence, or lattice ranking.",
  "construction": {
    "policy": "qe7.5-real-collinear-orbital-conjugation-identity-unitary-first-v1",
    "real_scope": "Bound scalar ordinary NC PBE UPFs, real radial data and symmetric real D; collinear separate real local spin potentials; no SOC, spinor, Hubbard/hybrid/vector-potential/external-field extension. Cubic signed-permutation crystal operations only.",
    "transformation": [
      "epsilon=+1 unitary, -1 orbital conjugation within SAME explicit spin",
      "k_t=epsilon*S*k_s+g, g integer; G_t=epsilon*S*G_s-g; native inherited row order",
      "c_t(G_t)=exp(-epsilon*2*pi*i*(G_s+k_s).f)*C_epsilon(c_s(G_s)); C_minus is complex conjugation",
      "Psi_t=U Psi_s* implies Gram_t=Gram_s*, D_t=D_s*; real populations unchanged",
      "density scalar pulls back without spin exchange; positive ionic gradient and force are conjugation-even polar vectors; physical current is conjugation-odd polar vector, including real-NC nonlocal current. Spatial covariance at transformed geometry only; no repair of rounded geometry/background."
    ],
    "selection": "Identity on saved representatives; otherwise unitary before conjugated route, XML operation index then source ik. Require complete mesh, every original source and exact source orbit weights independently per spin.",
    "preparation": "Reuse neutral UPF valence sum and zero-temperature symmetric-frame saved-label filling; independent spin/mesh quasifree sectors, free magnetization/common multiplier, empty initial PW complement. Raw MV occupations are retained as numerical metadata, never probabilities.",
    "coverage": "Decode every original source once for all header/row/cutoff admissions; only selected antiunitary frame and source state instantiated. Full slot population ledger is not a full material trajectory or full-grid Gram execution.",
    "adapter": "New RealBlochBasis is NOT old BlochBasis. New explicit adapter calls shared physical k+G factor implementation with honest orbital-conjugation provenance. Old loaded-only wrappers untouched."
  },
